   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "Phase222Description",
   "szText": "After helping Captain Aegel fend off the Drowned, she admitted she'd seen Lorath \"riding like hell for the Temple of Courage,\" alongside Tharra. They had better still be alive...",
